
sequenceDiagram
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Go Backend
    participant D as PostgreSQL

    F->>B: POST /v1/releases + JSON payload

    alt Invalid request body
        B-->>F: 400 Bad Request
    else Valid request body
        B->>D: INSERT new movie

        alt Insert succeeds
            D-->>B: Created movie with ID
            B-->>F: 201 Created + JSON data
        else Database failure
            D-->>B: Database error
            B-->>F: 500 Internal Server Error
        end
    end
